# NUKKAD environment variables
# Copy to .env.local for local development. Never commit .env.local.
#
# SECURITY RULE: anything prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_ is bundled into the website
# and visible to every visitor. Never put a secret in a NEXT_PUBLIC_ variable.
#
# No variables are needed yet.

# Public site URL, used for canonical links and sitemap once a domain exists.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://www.example.in

# Google Sheet menu (optional) — the sheet's "Publish to web → CSV" link.
# Public by design (the menu is public). See ADMIN_GUIDE.md.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_MENU_SHEET_CSV_URL=https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/e/…/pub?output=csv

# Google Sheet events tab (optional) — "Publish to web → CSV" link for the Events tab.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_EVENTS_SHEET_CSV_URL=https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/e/…/pub?gid=…&single=true&output=csv
